==Battleground==
*2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s (100%) spawn, delay 23.33~29.33 seconds<sup>700f~880f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] (100%) spawns.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] (200%) spawns.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] (100%) spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage is not that hard. All enemies here have pretty low damage, meaning the only thing you should concern yourself with is getting through both St. Pigge and Duche's high health pool. A stack of [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cats]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] should shred this level.

